. The steps are shown as connected boxes with arrows indicating the flow from left\ to right. Below the main flow, an arrow labeled "error feedback" loops back from the output step to the formula step, indicating a feedback mechanism to refine the process. The chart uses simple rectangular boxes and arrows to show the sequence and feedb\ack loop, highlighting a method for processing input through encoding, solving, and modeling to reach a final representation.)/K 22/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1644 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj32064 0 obj<</K 23/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1644 0 R/S/Caption/Type/StructElem>>endobj32065 0 obj<</K 26/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1644 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj32066 0 obj<</K 28/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1644 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj32067 0 obj<</K[30 32283 0 R 32]/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1644 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj32068 0 obj<</K 34/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1644 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj32069 0 obj<</K 36/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1644 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj32070 0 obj<</K 39/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1644 0 R/S/H3/Type/StructElem>>endobj32071 0 obj<</K[40 32282 0 R 43]/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1644 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj32072 0 obj<</K 4/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1647 0 R/S/H4/Type/StructElem>>endobj32073 0 obj<</K[5 32270 0 R 7 32271 0 R 10 32272 0 R 13 32273 0 R 16 32274 0 R 19 32275 0 R 22 32276 0 R 25 32277 0 R 28 32278 0 R 31 32279 0 R 34 32280 0 R 37]/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1647 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj32074 0 obj<</K[32253 0 R 32254 0 R]/P 32030 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj32075 0 obj<</K[69 32249 0 R 72 32250 0 R 75 32251 0 R 78 32252 0 R 81]/P 32030 0 R/Pg 1647 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj32076 0 obj<</A 32248 0 R/Alt(A set named C superscript w of small phi is defined as the union of several subsets. The first subset contains pairs of v sub i superscript alpha and negative v sub i superscript beta where negative v sub i superscript beta is in SubF of small phi, for i \from 1 to N of small phi. The second subset contains pairs of v sub i