 corres\pond to different logical inference steps. The main strategy combines these to prove formulas. This formal system is important for automated reasoning and logic proof verification, showing how logical formulas can be systematically broken down and analyze\d.)/K[31]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 395 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj49532 0 obj<</K[33 49627 0 R 35]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 395 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49533 0 obj<</K 38/P 49504 0 R/Pg 395 0 R/S/H3/Type/StructElem>>endobj49534 0 obj<</K 39/P 49504 0 R/Pg 395 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49535 0 obj<</K<</MCID 0/Pg 398 0 R/Type/MCR>>/P 49504 0 R/Pg 395 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49536 0 obj<</K 2/P 49504 0 R/Pg 398 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49537 0 obj<</K[3 49626 0 R]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 398 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49538 0 obj<</K 6/P 49504 0 R/Pg 398 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49539 0 obj<</K 9/P 49504 0 R/Pg 398 0 R/S/H4/Type/StructElem>>endobj49540 0 obj<</K 10/P 49504 0 R/Pg 398 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49541 0 obj<</K 1/P 49504 0 R/Pg 401 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49542 0 obj<</K 4/P 49504 0 R/Pg 401 0 R/S/H5/Type/StructElem>>endobj49543 0 obj<</K 5/P 49504 0 R/Pg 401 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49544 0 obj<</K[49606 0 R 49607 0 R 49608 0 R 49609 0 R 49610 0 R]/P 49504 0 R/S/L/Type/StructElem>>endobj49545 0 obj<</K[16 49604 0 R 18]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 401 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49546 0 obj<</K 19/P 49504 0 R/Pg 401 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj49547 0 obj<</K 21/P 49504 0 R/Pg 401 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49548 0 obj<</K 1/P 49504 0 R/Pg 404 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49549 0 obj<</K 4/P 49504 0 R/Pg 404 0 R/S/H3/Type/StructElem>>endobj49550 0 obj<</K 5/P 49504 0 R/Pg 404 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49551 0 obj<</K 8/P 49504 0 R/Pg 404 0 R/S/H4/Type/StructElem>>endobj49552 0 obj<</K 9/P 49504 0 R/Pg 404 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49553 0 obj<</K 10/P 49504 0 R/Pg 404 0 R/S/P/Type/Struc