 applying these rules repeatedly. The main strategy named prove uses these reduction strategies to process logical statements. This specification outlines a method for systematically prov\ing logical formulas by breaking them down into simpler parts.)/K[10 49592 0 R]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 407 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj49562 0 obj<</K[3 49590 0 R]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 412 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49563 0 obj<</K 8/P 49504 0 R/Pg 412 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj49564 0 obj<</K 10/P 49504 0 R/Pg 412 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49565 0 obj<</K 11/P 49504 0 R/Pg 412 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49566 0 obj<</K 12/P 49504 0 R/Pg 412 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49567 0 obj<</K 14/P 49504 0 R/Pg 412 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49568 0 obj<</K 3/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj49569 0 obj<</K 7/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49570 0 obj<</K 9/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49571 0 obj<</K 11/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49572 0 obj<</K[13 49588 0 R]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49573 0 obj<</K 25/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49574 0 obj<</K[27 49586 0 R]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49575 0 obj<</K 39/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49576 0 obj<</K 41/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49577 0 obj<</K[43 49584 0 R]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49578 0 obj<</K[56 49582 0 R 67]/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49579 0 obj<</K 68/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj49580 0 obj<</K 72/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj49581 0 obj<</A<</BBox[53.576999 65.372969 110.270995 85.214965]/O/Layout>>/Alt(Openaccess logo␀)/K 83/P 49504 0 R/Pg 415 0 R/S/Figure/T()/Type/StructElem>>endobj49582 0 obj<</K 49583 0 R/P 49578 0 R/S/Reference/Type/StructElem>>endobj49583 0 o