 in A sub extract; if the count is zero, it returns A sub extract and end\s the procedure. This procedure outlines steps to generate and verify abstractions from input data using recursive tree operations and term extraction.␀)/K[81]/P 50381 0 R/Pg 284 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj50445 0 obj<</K[84 50876 0 R 86 50877 0 R 88]/P 50381 0 R/Pg 284 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50446 0 obj<</K 89/P 50381 0 R/Pg 284 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50447 0 obj<</K 1/P 50381 0 R/Pg 287 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50448 0 obj<</K 3/P 50381 0 R/Pg 287 0 R/S/H2/Type/StructElem>>endobj50449 0 obj<</K[5 50872 0 R 7 50873 0 R 9]/P 50381 0 R/Pg 287 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50450 0 obj<</ActualText( \\bUnALT{}e\\cdot x \\rightarrow x\\qquad x^{-1}\\cdot x \\rightarrow e\\qquad \(x\\cdot y\)\\cdot z \\rightarrow x\\cdot\(y\\cdot z\)\\eUnALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 10/P 50381 0 R/Pg 287 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50451 0 obj<</K[13 50871 0 R 16]/P 50381 0 R/Pg 287 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50452 0 obj<</ActualText( \\bUnALT{}\(x^{-1}\\cdot x\)\\cdot y \\rightarrow e \\cdot y \\rightarrow y \\qquad \(x^{-1}\\cdot x\)\\cdot y \\rightarrow x^{-1} \\cdot \(x \\cdot y\),\\eUnALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 17/P 50381 0 R/Pg 287 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50453 0 obj<</K[19 50869 0 R 22 50870 0 R 25]/P 50381 0 R/Pg 287 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50454 0 obj<</K[26 50864 0 R 28 50865 0 R 31 50866 0 R 33]/P 50381 0 R/Pg 287 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50455 0 obj<</K[1 50862 0 R 3]/P 50381 0 R/Pg 292 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50456 0 obj<</ActualText(\\bUnALT{} w\(t = u\) &= w\(t\) + w\(u\) \\\\ w\(x\) &= 1, \\textrm{ if $x$ is a variable} \\\\ w\(F\(t_1, \\ldots, t_n\)\) &= 1 + \\sum_{i=1}^n w\(t_i\), \\textrm{ if $F$ is a function symbol }\\eUnALT{} )/Border[0 0 0]/K 4/P 50381 0 R/Pg 292 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50457 0 obj<</K[7 50859 0 R 9 50860 0 R 12]/P 50381 0 R/Pg 292 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj50458 0 